        { "citation": "yi4abjp5", "lang": "en", "page": "11", "plate": "", "url": "" }
      ], "text": "His adornments are chiseled, and well wrought, they are made of gold and precious stones"
    }, "type": "maxim" },
    { "active": "1", "code": "", "identifier": "", "image": "", "lang": "fr-FR", "route": "", "translation": {
      "citations": [
        { "citation": "mxzmbv4m", "lang": "fr", "page": "106", "plate": "", "url": "" }
      ], "text": "Comme toute chose précieuse, ne brille de son éclat qu'à l'aide du travail du joaillier"
    }, "type": "maxim" },
    { "active": "1", "code": "", "identifier": "", "image": "", "lang": "fr-FR", "route": "", "translation": {
      "citations": [
        { "citation": "17pzm9pe", "lang": "fr", "page": "180", "plate": "", "url": "" }
      ], "text": "D'or et de jade il se compose; les ornaments sont fait au ciseau"
    }, "type": "maxim" },
    { "active": "1", "code": "", "identifier": "", "image": "", "lang": "fr-FR", "route": "", "translation": {
      "citations": [
        { "citation": "jwb4rurt", "lang": "fr", "page": "210", "plate": "", "url": "" }
      ], "text": "Ses ornaments sont ciselés et bien travaillés, l'or et les pierres précieuses en forment la matière"
    }, "type": "maxim" },
    { "active": "1", "code": "", "identifier": "", "image": "", "lang": "ja-JP", "route": "", "translation": {
      "citations": [
        { "citation": "oicprxpn", "lang": "ja", "page": "12", "plate": "", "url": "" }
      ], "text": "王の栄光を金や玉石に彫り残し、そのお姿を宝物としよう"
